repository-code: "https://github.com/ktwyw/engreact"
keywords:
  - chemical reaction engineering
  - reactor design
  - chemical kinetics
  - catalysis
  - residence time distribution
  - reactor safety
  - engineering education
abstract: >-
  Readable, validated Python for an undergraduate course in chemical reaction engineering - kinetics and
  rate-data analysis, ideal reactors, multiple reactions, energy balances with multiple steady states and
  runaway, heterogeneous catalysis and transport, catalyst deactivation, residence-time distributions,
  bioreactors and gas-solid reactions - checked against analytic solutions, independent numerical
  integration and published values, with an 18-notebook course and worked solutions.
